+# Research Roadmap v461 — PHASE D: the off-ARC distributional-energy verifier moat (FIRST execution)
+
+**Milestone:** 2026.06.461
+**Planned by:** outer-loop Claude Opus 4.8 planner, 2026-06-29 (UTC)
